title: 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_neg>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
(As I enter the club room, I see NaHyun sitting in front of the club computer.)
(She seems incredibly focused on something.)
<<play 공통_키보드>>
(Getting closer, I see she’s playing a game.)
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: (Glancing at me) Oh, hey.
{name()}: Hey. Are you playing WapleStory?
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: Yeah. I'm taking down a boss monster right now, so...
(NaHyun seems to be struggling with multitasking.)
(I stood behind her and watched her flashy play.)
(She barely clears it and lets out a laugh.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: Phew. I thought I was a goner for a second.
{name()}: You're pretty good.
NaHyun: Of course I am.
<<choice 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_긍1_영문 "Of course!" 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_부1_영문 "Do I look like the type of person who plays that?">>
NaHyun: Do you play WapleStory too?
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_긍1_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +10>>
{name()}: I was actually playing it right before I went to bed last night.
<<show hyun_spec>>
NaHyun: For real? What server are you on?
(NaHyun’s eyes sparkle.)
(I sat next to her, turned on the computer, and added her as a friend in the game.)
(I played WapleStory with NaHyun until the next period started.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_부1_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
{name()}: No. I know what it is, though.
NaHyun: Ah... I see.
<<choice 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_긍2_영문 "If you're recommending it, then..." 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_부2_영문 "Why would I?">>
NaHyun: Are you interested in giving it a try?
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_긍2_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +15>>
{name()}: Sure. Since we're on the subject, should I start right now?
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: If you start, I'll help you out.
(I sat next to her, turned on the computer, and signed up for an account.)
(I played WapleStory with NaHyun until the next period started.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_부2_영문
---
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
{name()}: Nah, those kinds of games aren't really my thing.
<<show hyun_neg2>>
NaHyun: Why would you even say something like that?
<<choice 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_긍2_영문 "I-I'm just kidding. If you're recommending it, I'll try." 주2_화_2교시_동아리방_양나현_부2_영문 "Why would I?">>
(NaHyun stares straight into your eyes.)
===